        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "74. Those are the noblest persons who, giving up self-in-",
          "end": "hyphen"
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "terest, bring about the good of others; those that undertake",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 3,
          "text": "",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 4,
          "text": "a business for the sake of others, not inconsistent with their",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 5,
          "text": "",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 6,
          "text": "own good, are men of the middle order; those that stand",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 7,
          "text": "in the way of the good of others for their own benefit are",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 8,
          "text": "demons in a human form; but we know not what to call",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 9,
          "text": "",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 10,
          "text": "them (lit. who they are ) that oppose the good of others",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
